{"channelId":"UCOFIiqkbXPIERwVrAiGzy3g","row":["UC Davis Weill School of Veterinary Medicine",7520,"UC Davis Weill School of Veterinary Medicine is a nationally top-ranked academic medical center based in Davis, California with a school, hospital, specialty clinics, research centers and institutes, and other operations throughout the state and the world.\n\nWe serve California through premier educational, research, clinical, and public service programs to advance the health of animals and people, and the environment we share. We also safeguard the health of livestock, dairy, and poultry—critical to California's robust agricultural economy.\n\nOur One Health approach encompasses captive and free-ranging wildlife, companion animals, exotic animals, birds, aquatic mammals, and fish. Our researchers are at the forefront of discoveries that translate to improved care for humans as well as animals.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOFIiqkbXPIERwVrAiGzy3g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOFIiqkbXPIERwVrAiGzy3g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:18.065Z","channelId":"UCOFIiqkbXPIERwVrAiGzy3g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"3a6595a64b0cb6008bf2410be638242ae69f9c8514359ef0b17e31bd81f3871c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"3102b18305015bc644fbd4760112cd36b234c4b9678929b06f1d21d17ca8c044"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOFIiqkbXPIERwVrAiGzy3g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T07:59:34.308Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOFIiqkbXPIERwVrAiGzy3g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":7520,"raw":"7.52K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOFIiqkbXPIERwVrAiGzy3g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:18.065Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant